# Brain private workspace backup safety defaults
# Keep secret-bearing, noisy, and local-cache paths out of private Git backups.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
*.env.*
!*.env.example
config/*.env
config/*.env.*
secrets/**
logs/**
tmp/**
cache/**
caches/**
state/setup-progress.json
state/telegram-offset.json
state/telegram-pairing/**
state/jobs/**
state/events/**
private/documents/files/**
.claude/repo-registry/runtime/node_modules/**
.claude/repo-registry/runtime/dist/**
.claude/repo-registry/runtime/.turbo/**
**/.cache/**
**/node_modules/**
**/*.log

# Keep generated/runtime scratch artifacts local unless deliberately included.
artifacts/**
!artifacts/metadata/**
